{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00847","headline":"郊庙歌辞 晋昭德成功舞歌 昭德舞歌二首 一 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 晋昭德成功舞歌 昭德舞歌二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣代修文德，明庭举旧章。\n两阶陈羽龠，万舞合宫商。\n劒佩森鸳鹭，箫韶下凤凰。\n我朝青史上，千古有辉光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}